When Cursor auto-generates a Git commit message, 
use the Conventional Commits format with an English prefix 
(e.g., feat:, fix:, refactor:) followed by a brief Chinese description. 
For multiple changes, separate them with / (e.g., feat: 完善数据库 / 一键启动配置). Keep it concise.

Do not create, modify, or suggest test files (*.spec.ts, *.e2e-spec.ts, jest config). 
This project does not use automated tests.